## ObjectType: Recorded Recall Control

Local operational extension; no equivalent GS1 class asserted.

### Data Properties

| Name | Display Name | Type | Description | Mapped Field |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| snapshot_id | Snapshot id | string | Stable unique source-row identifier. | snapshot_id |
| recall_id | Recall id | string | Foreign key to recalls; blank creates no edge. | recall_id |
| product_id | Product id | string | Foreign key to products; blank creates no edge. | product_id |
| as_of_date | As of date | date | Day-only date governed by business and knowledge cutoff contract. | as_of_date |
| knowledge_date | Knowledge date | date | Day-only date governed by business and knowledge cutoff contract. | knowledge_date |
| unit | Unit | string | Synthetic business value with equivalent bilingual meaning. Allowed values: ea. | unit |
| controlled_quantity | Controlled quantity | decimal | Exact Decimal value; units/rules follow business contract; unknown is not zero. | controlled_quantity |
| controllable_quantity | Controllable quantity | decimal | Exact Decimal value; units/rules follow business contract; unknown is not zero. | controllable_quantity |
| coverage_ratio | Coverage ratio | decimal | Recorded dated snapshot, not live reconstruction; unknown remains null. | coverage_ratio |

### Keys

Primary Keys: snapshot_id
Display Key: snapshot_id
